        "id": "lem-qc-tqc-zero-logical-error-forces-zero-leakage",
        "kind": "lemma",
        "title": "Exact logical-block correctness forces zero leakage",
        "statement_or_definition": "Let $J:\\mathcal C\\to V$ be an isometric encoding with $P=JJ^*$, let $U$ be\nunitary on $\\mathcal C$, and let $W$ be unitary on $V$. If the logical block\nerror $\\|PWP-JUJ^*\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$ is zero, then the leakage amplitude\n$\\|(I-P)WP\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$ is zero.",
        "deps": [
          "def-qc-tqc-logical-error-and-leakage",
          "def-linear-isometry-and-orthogonal-or-unitary-operator",
          "def-inner-product-norm"
        ],
        "justified_by": [],
        "dependency_level": 6,
        "proof_obligations": [
          "1.1 Zero block error means $PWP=JUJ^*$ as operators on $V$. For every\n$x\\in\\mathcal C$, $J^*J=I_{\\mathcal C}$ gives\n$PWJx=PWPJx=JUJ^*Jx=JUx$. By [F2], $\\|WJx\\|=\\|x\\|$ and\n$\\|PWJx\\|=\\|JUx\\|=\\|Ux\\|=\\|x\\|$. [given, F1, F2, algebra]",
          "1.2 The decomposition $WJx=PWJx+(I-P)WJx$ is orthogonal by [F1]. Its\nPythagorean identity and step 1.1 give\n$\\|(I-P)WJx\\|^2=\\|WJx\\|^2-\\|PWJx\\|^2=0$ for every $x$. Hence\n$(I-P)WJ=0$, and since $P=JJ^*$, $(I-P)WP=0$; its operator norm is zero.\n[F1, F2, step 1.1, algebra] ∎"
        ],
